OL,3,GNEWSATeam to oversee South East Water
OL,4,Aimprovement plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA team has been appointed to oversee
OL,7,Fturnaround plans at South East Water
OL,8,Fafter three investigations found
OL,9,Frepeated failures at the company.
OL,11,FConsultants Grant Thornton will track
OL,12,FSouth East Water's enforced investment
OL,13,Fafter Ofwat found issues with the water
OL,14,Fcompany's governance, operations and
OL,15,Ffinancial resilience in July.
OL,17,FSouth East Water was ordered to spend
OL,18,F#30.5m on a range of improvements after
OL,19,Fsupply issues hit thousands of homes in
OL,20,FKent and Sussex.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
